{ENU}
v1.0 2010-11-17 Nem First edition
v1.1 2011-01-09 Nem Correction SunTime() for the polar night and polar day
v1.2 2015-12-17 Byd Normalization function modified to handle big numbers
v1.3 2016-11-07 Vla Correction SunAzimuth() - new alorithm implemented
                    by Martin Vích Vlasák, Technical university Liberec
v1.4 2019-04-04 Byd Omitted automatic shift of UTC time offset for daylight saving time in function SunTime, when there were enabled automatic change of daylight saving time in PLC
